Use’s Box[int, []int] determines both the receiver’s type argument and Make’s
type argument. The receiver parameter A is called R in the method declaration,
where S’s constraint refers to it. Accept Factory[int] and call
factory.Make[[]int]().
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
output: plumb_gen.go
-- example.com/app/app.go --
package app

type Factory[A any] struct{}
type Box[A, B any] struct{}

//plumb:build
func (Factory[R]) Make[S ~[]R]() Box[R, S] { return Box[R, S]{} }

//plumb:build
func Use(b Box[int, []int]) bool { return true }
